WEBVTT

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.600 --> 00:46.786
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.600 --> 00:46.787
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.020 --> 00:56.153
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.020 --> 00:56.154
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.769 --> 01:14.817
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.776 --> 01:14.817
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.798 --> 01:30.718
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.637 --> 01:33.972
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.848 --> 01:35.891
Black Jack.

01:52.386 --> 01:53.678
Athsma trim.

02:02.855 --> 02:09.611
He works so masterfully on one of the most
complex surgical operations, a thoracic aortic aneurysm.

02:09.612 --> 02:11.571
He is as good as the rumors have said.

02:12.031 --> 02:16.117
We don't have many people who are
as highly skilled as he is, either.

02:18.246 --> 02:20.372
3:23 PM, operation completed.

02:20.373 --> 02:21.248
Good job.

02:32.828 --> 02:35.975
Originally by Tezuka Osamu "Pinoco Returns"

02:32.828 --> 02:35.975
Missing Pinoco

02:38.708 --> 02:39.958
Will this do?

02:41.044 --> 02:42.139
40,000,000.

02:42.379 --> 02:43.087
Fine.

02:44.005 --> 02:46.340
You really saved us.

02:46.341 --> 02:48.675
Can I count on you again?

02:48.897 --> 02:49.634
Anytime.

02:49.886 --> 02:50.469
See you.

03:01.773 --> 03:07.936
Mr. President, thank you for letting
us watch the operation today.

03:08.196 --> 03:12.324
I am honored that I could help the
World Doctor's Association.

03:12.534 --> 03:16.662
But why did you want to watch Black Jack's work?

03:23.753 --> 03:26.797
Largo! Here's your treat!

03:29.570 --> 03:30.917
Not here.

03:31.136 --> 03:33.512
I told her to guard the house!

03:33.513 --> 03:35.472
She went off already.

03:41.855 --> 03:42.938
Largo?

03:48.945 --> 03:50.821
Who are you?

03:51.865 --> 03:53.866
Oh, just a kid.

03:53.867 --> 03:55.242
Don't scare me.

03:55.577 --> 03:57.035
I'm not a kid.

03:58.955 --> 04:01.206
I'm 18 years old!

04:04.130 --> 04:05.130
I know!

04:05.253 --> 04:06.962
You must be robber!

04:07.672 --> 04:09.131
Don't talk so loud.

04:09.132 --> 04:11.174
I haven't stolen anything yet.

04:13.177 --> 04:15.971
I've never seen a robber before.

04:16.931 --> 04:19.725
It's embarrassing when you stare at me like that.

04:19.767 --> 04:23.854
Largo! Why aren't you barking when a robber is here?

04:24.731 --> 04:26.947
Missy, don't yell at her.

04:27.233 --> 04:29.192
She is just nice.

04:30.028 --> 04:32.571
When I was trying to enter this house,

04:35.158 --> 04:37.909
she brought the key to me, and helped me.

04:39.120 --> 04:40.203
Ohmi...

04:41.956 --> 04:44.583
Gewdness!!

04:44.959 --> 04:49.379
She just can't help but help out people in trouble.

04:49.380 --> 04:51.006
Good girl.

04:52.133 --> 04:55.677
What are you doing, befriending a robber?

04:55.678 --> 04:59.556
But this is the first time that Largo is okay with a stranger.

05:01.142 --> 05:04.728
So, Mr. Robber, what do you need here?

05:04.729 --> 05:06.938
What else would a robber need?

05:06.939 --> 05:09.271
I need the doctor's money.

05:09.387 --> 05:12.277
It's rumored that he saves tons!

05:12.405 --> 05:14.323
That's not true.

05:14.324 --> 05:16.380
We are always poor.

05:16.502 --> 05:17.743
We have no money.

05:18.369 --> 05:22.164
If it's not here, then could it buried somewhere outside?

05:22.165 --> 05:25.064
Or is it hidden in the attic?

05:25.376 --> 05:26.251
I don't know.

05:27.086 --> 05:29.212
I really need money!

05:29.213 --> 05:30.255
Can you tell me?

05:30.256 --> 05:30.691
Please?

05:30.923 --> 05:33.425
Why do you need money so much?

05:34.927 --> 05:36.992
Thanks for asking.

05:37.472 --> 05:41.423
My family owned a fish market.

05:42.727 --> 05:45.979
It was a small shop, but it was going well.

05:46.481 --> 05:49.941
I had a slightly strong-minded but hardworking wife,

05:49.942 --> 05:53.362
and a daughter about your age.

05:53.571 --> 05:55.751
We were all happy.

05:56.115 --> 06:00.494
But a large supermarket was built
close to the shopping district,

06:00.495 --> 06:02.829
and took all of our customers.

06:03.289 --> 06:05.832
Eventually, our shop went bankrupt.

06:06.376 --> 06:08.251
We only had debts.

06:08.252 --> 06:11.380
My wife gave up on me for not working anymore,

06:12.173 --> 06:15.550
and left with my daughter.

06:16.969 --> 06:19.552
So I need money,

06:19.847 --> 06:21.831
so I can open the shop again,

06:22.141 --> 06:24.935
so my wife and daughter will come back.

06:26.521 --> 06:29.439
What is your daughter's name?

06:29.690 --> 06:31.441
Her name is Hiroko.

06:31.734 --> 06:33.360
I am Pinoco.

06:33.361 --> 06:35.175
It's close to Hiroko.

06:35.296 --> 06:37.322
Poor Hiroko-chan.

06:38.950 --> 06:39.825
Don't you think so?

06:39.826 --> 06:41.993
So can you tell me where the money is?

06:42.453 --> 06:44.538
Your doctor makes a little too much money,

06:44.997 --> 06:47.999
so it's okay for a guy like me to take some, right?

06:48.459 --> 06:49.751
It's charity!

06:49.836 --> 06:50.606
I understand.

06:50.704 --> 06:52.963
I'll ask Doc.

06:55.550 --> 06:56.842
You must be kidding me.

06:58.845 --> 06:59.970
No good!

06:59.971 --> 07:01.428
I can't find it.

07:01.542 --> 07:02.889
I should give up.

07:03.349 --> 07:05.833
Missy, bye.

07:06.310 --> 07:07.853
Wait, sir.

07:09.188 --> 07:11.648
Would you tell me your name and address?

07:11.983 --> 07:13.483
Idiot!

07:13.484 --> 07:18.446
In what world would you find a robber who leaves
his name and address in a place he broke into?!

07:18.447 --> 07:21.825
If I find some money, I'll deliver it.

07:24.036 --> 07:24.995
Really?

07:24.996 --> 07:27.414
You're so nice.

07:27.498 --> 07:30.125
It's all for poor Hiroko-chan.

07:30.626 --> 07:34.379
Missy, don't tell Doc about me.

07:34.380 --> 07:36.006
I know.

07:37.174 --> 07:39.593
This is where I live.

07:39.594 --> 07:43.388
Remember, this is a secret between you and me.

07:43.806 --> 07:44.556
Yeah!

07:45.516 --> 07:46.433
See ya!

07:46.434 --> 07:47.642
Bye bye!

07:50.797 --> 07:51.897
Largo,

07:51.898 --> 07:56.776
we must clean this room up before Doc gets home!

08:13.586 --> 08:14.586
Welcome home.

08:15.379 --> 08:16.338
Thank you.

08:16.339 --> 08:19.507
Honey, did you make more money?

08:20.176 --> 08:23.094
Hey, don't put it so negatively.

08:23.804 --> 08:25.722
Dinner is ready.

08:25.723 --> 08:26.598
Thanks.

08:29.352 --> 08:31.790
Hey, can I ask for something?

08:32.146 --> 08:32.845
What is it?

08:33.439 --> 08:35.106
I want an allowance.

08:35.816 --> 08:36.691
Allowance?

08:37.401 --> 08:40.502
So, you have something you want to buy?

08:40.905 --> 08:42.489
So, how much do you want?

08:43.407 --> 08:45.575
How about 1,000,000?

08:47.014 --> 08:47.744
Idiot!

08:47.745 --> 08:50.330
You have no monetary sense!

08:50.634 --> 08:51.511
Fine.

08:51.707 --> 08:54.367
I'll give you 1,000 yen every month.

08:54.710 --> 08:57.590
Then you can buy any snacks you want.

08:58.005 --> 09:00.757
Then can I have my allowance for a year now?

09:04.595 --> 09:07.013
Hey, what are you going to use that for?

09:07.014 --> 09:10.141
A wife's secret savings are important.

09:10.575 --> 09:12.423
Don't waste the money.

09:12.686 --> 09:14.104
Yes, yes.

09:21.737 --> 09:23.321
Pinoco! Phone!

09:25.491 --> 09:26.825
Hey, Pinoco.

09:27.284 --> 09:27.867
Pino...

09:29.120 --> 09:30.745
I'm running some errands...

09:29.120 --> 09:30.745
Note says: "I'm running some errands..."

09:31.872 --> 09:33.498
Errands in the morning?

09:35.835 --> 09:36.459
Yes.

09:36.877 --> 09:38.294
Are you Black Jack?

09:38.712 --> 09:39.504
Yes, I am.

09:39.839 --> 09:42.382
I'm calling from the World Doctor's Association.

09:43.259 --> 09:44.634
World Doctor's Association?

09:45.094 --> 09:45.885
Yes.

09:45.886 --> 09:50.912
The association members are visiting Japan
to attend the general meeting in Tokyo

09:50.912 --> 09:52.559
that is being held today and tomorrow.

09:52.935 --> 09:59.524
They are very anxious about you not possessing a medical
license while being a highly skilled surgeon.

09:59.525 --> 10:01.860
They are saying that after having a talk with you,

10:01.861 --> 10:07.907
they can deal with the Japan Doctor's
Union to issue you a license.

10:08.117 --> 10:13.955
Is it okay for the World Doctor's Association to
issue a license to me with just an interview?

10:13.956 --> 10:20.670
Oh no, they watched your work at
Central Hospital the other day.

10:21.046 --> 10:22.088
I see.

10:22.089 --> 10:24.674
Once the association members are done with the meeting,

10:24.675 --> 10:27.427
they must leave for the next meeting.

10:27.428 --> 10:28.469
I know this is short notice,

10:28.470 --> 10:32.807
but are you free between 3 and 4 PM tomorrow?

10:33.017 --> 10:34.017
I see.

10:34.018 --> 10:34.866
OK.

10:35.060 --> 10:37.186
Then I will see you then.

10:37.396 --> 10:43.151
Then come to the Tokyo Empire Hotel,
room 1025, at three o'clock.

10:43.152 --> 10:44.944
I'll be waiting for you there.

10:44.945 --> 10:45.320
Thank you.

10:45.571 --> 10:48.865
I am very happy for you, doctor.

10:48.866 --> 10:50.450
Congratulations.

10:50.951 --> 10:51.843
Bye.

10:59.001 --> 11:00.293
Medical license, huh?

11:02.004 --> 11:03.796
There's no time to hesitate!

11:04.381 --> 11:05.965
It's time critical!

11:06.425 --> 11:08.426
But a law is a law.

11:08.427 --> 11:12.639
No such transplant is allowed in this country.

11:12.848 --> 11:17.185
Damn a law that would endanger a patient's life!

11:17.186 --> 11:19.479
You won't have any problems if I take full responsibility?

11:19.480 --> 11:20.855
I will do it!

11:23.776 --> 11:25.735
You fail as a doctor!

11:25.736 --> 11:27.570
I'm revoking your license!

11:28.656 --> 11:30.284
It's been a while since then.

11:30.574 --> 11:33.326
The license is coming back to me...

11:45.746 --> 11:46.954
Let's see...

11:50.336 --> 11:51.876
Excuse me.

11:52.043 --> 11:54.712
If you are a debt collector, I don't have any.

11:56.131 --> 11:56.964
Missy!

11:58.008 --> 12:00.176
I didn't expect you to come.

12:00.552 --> 12:02.928
I promised you.

12:02.929 --> 12:04.472
That's true, but...

12:04.473 --> 12:08.726
but you didn't really bring me money, did you?

12:08.977 --> 12:10.686
I did.

12:11.938 --> 12:13.731
You can start your business again with this money,

12:13.732 --> 12:17.031
and live with your wife and Hiroko-chan.

12:17.235 --> 12:18.402
I'll let you borrow it.

12:19.821 --> 12:22.531
I can't restart my business with this,

12:22.532 --> 12:25.451
but I can use it to get my losses back!

12:25.911 --> 12:28.204
Thank you, missy!

12:28.371 --> 12:29.955
I'm not giving that to you.

12:29.956 --> 12:31.540
I'm letting you borrow it.

12:31.541 --> 12:33.584
Give it back to me no matter how many years it takes.

12:33.960 --> 12:36.045
I know, I know!

12:36.046 --> 12:37.755
OK! Let's go out!

12:38.423 --> 12:39.465
Come on!

12:39.466 --> 12:40.716
Where are we going?!

12:41.843 --> 12:43.594
You'll see!

12:43.720 --> 12:45.846
Hey, where?

12:52.729 --> 12:56.482
How long is Pinoco going to be running errands?

12:57.484 --> 12:59.026
Do you know anything?

13:08.119 --> 13:12.998
Sir, did you lose money again?

13:14.000 --> 13:16.293
I'm sorry, missy.

13:24.594 --> 13:26.470
Was she kidnapped?

13:29.933 --> 13:30.891
Let's go, Largo.

13:42.445 --> 13:44.863
Sir, let's go home.

13:44.864 --> 13:48.116
Hiriko-chan will get worried if you're out too late.

13:48.410 --> 13:51.461
Neither Hiroko or my wife will be there when I get home!

13:51.663 --> 13:53.664
I'm no good!

13:53.707 --> 13:55.958
You're so helpless.

13:55.959 --> 13:58.127
You're a grown-up, so don't cry.

14:11.433 --> 14:12.391
Pinoco...

14:14.269 --> 14:15.269
Missy,

14:15.812 --> 14:17.688
would you go on a journey with me?

14:17.897 --> 14:20.482
I go on trips with Doc all the time.

14:20.483 --> 14:22.192
I've even gotten on airplanes.

14:22.193 --> 14:23.152
Airplanes?

14:23.153 --> 14:24.653
That's not good.

14:24.654 --> 14:25.932
They cost money.

14:26.114 --> 14:27.281
We walk.

14:27.741 --> 14:29.116
It'll be fun.

14:29.117 --> 14:30.659
Where are we going?

14:30.952 --> 14:32.661
To my wife's family's place.

14:33.538 --> 14:35.372
It's not that far.

14:36.082 --> 14:37.916
We'll get there in a day.

14:38.543 --> 14:42.087
Sir, you really want to see Hiroko-chan.

14:49.220 --> 14:50.512
Did you pick up her scent?

14:54.601 --> 14:57.936
Oh, Gen-san took that girl somewhere during the day.

14:58.229 --> 14:59.396
Gen-san?

14:59.564 --> 15:03.942
He's a lazy man who doesn't even have a job.

15:03.943 --> 15:05.402
See, that's the house.

15:11.951 --> 15:14.776
Dear, how are you doing?

15:15.163 --> 15:19.082
Hiroko says she wants to see you every day.

15:41.272 --> 15:43.607
Sir, it's the aquarium!

15:43.608 --> 15:44.943
Fish, huh?

15:45.235 --> 15:46.485
Do you want to stop by?

15:46.486 --> 15:47.194
Yeah!

15:50.406 --> 15:53.200
There are so many kinds of fish!

15:55.662 --> 15:57.663
A big fish!

15:57.664 --> 15:58.956
That's the mora-mora.

15:58.957 --> 16:00.499
It's in the shark family,

16:00.500 --> 16:02.584
and big ones get larger than 2 meters.

16:03.127 --> 16:05.462
They live in warm water.

16:05.463 --> 16:07.130
They don't have dense meat,

16:07.131 --> 16:09.758
but they are loaded and fat, and
are delicious if you grill them.

16:09.759 --> 16:11.552
You know them well.

16:11.970 --> 16:15.556
I've been good with fish since I was a kid.

16:15.807 --> 16:18.600
That's why you opened a fish market.

16:18.601 --> 16:19.560
Well, yeah.

16:19.978 --> 16:23.939
That fish is called the horn fish and they
live in the warm southern waters.

16:24.411 --> 16:27.357
Caretakers Wanted!!

16:32.615 --> 16:34.116
Oh, that family...

16:34.117 --> 16:35.284
Not a family!

16:36.744 --> 16:38.370
They went straight down that path.

16:40.331 --> 16:42.582
Well, I didn't see them.

16:47.755 --> 16:48.630
It's three.

16:49.632 --> 16:52.009
I'll see you at three o'clock.

16:56.097 --> 16:58.265
You fail as a doctor!

16:58.433 --> 16:59.766
I'm revoking your license!

17:07.150 --> 17:08.900
Pinoco, stay safe!

17:17.910 --> 17:19.202
He's not answering?

17:19.203 --> 17:19.995
No.

17:19.996 --> 17:22.456
It's past the promised three o'clock.

17:22.707 --> 17:24.958
We can't wait here forever.

17:25.376 --> 17:27.252
We must leave soon.

17:27.253 --> 17:28.420
We can't help it.

17:31.257 --> 17:32.883
It's his rare chance...

17:45.188 --> 17:47.439
How long is it going to take at this pace?

17:48.900 --> 17:50.984
Sir, I'm cold.

17:51.861 --> 17:53.779
It's not that cold today...

17:54.113 --> 17:55.238
I see!

17:55.239 --> 17:57.449
You haven't eaten anything today!

17:57.450 --> 17:58.366
That's why!

18:00.870 --> 18:03.028
OK, then let's hitchhike.

18:03.247 --> 18:05.406
Let's get a ride to some town.

18:05.666 --> 18:07.918
Then I'll earn some money there.

18:08.961 --> 18:11.296
Are you going to rob someone again?!

18:11.297 --> 18:12.506
Don't do it!

18:13.049 --> 18:15.926
We'll die from hunger like this.

18:15.927 --> 18:17.886
But you mustn't steal!

18:17.887 --> 18:19.638
Anyway, let's get to the highway.

18:21.891 --> 18:23.600
Hey, good timing.

18:27.897 --> 18:29.064
It's Largo!

18:29.065 --> 18:30.190
Largo!

18:30.983 --> 18:31.650
Pinoco!

18:34.153 --> 18:36.404
You kidnapped Pinoco!

18:37.073 --> 18:39.108
Oh, uh...

18:37.782 --> 18:39.108
Doc!

18:39.450 --> 18:40.367
Wait!

18:47.250 --> 18:48.625
Doc!

18:49.001 --> 18:50.502
Doc!

18:51.170 --> 18:52.087
Pinoco!

18:52.505 --> 18:53.380
Are you okay?

18:55.883 --> 18:57.259
I'm sorry.

18:57.802 --> 18:58.635
Don't cry.

18:58.636 --> 18:59.636
It's okay as long as you're safe.

19:03.307 --> 19:05.475
Doc, save him!

19:05.476 --> 19:06.685
Why should I?

19:07.186 --> 19:08.562
Doc, please!

19:08.563 --> 19:10.480
He's a really miserable man.

19:20.866 --> 19:21.825
Where am I?

19:23.536 --> 19:25.662
Pinoco told me everything.

19:26.414 --> 19:28.123
I'm sorry!

19:28.165 --> 19:30.166
Never do this again!

19:30.751 --> 19:31.376
No.

19:31.586 --> 19:33.211
Your injuries are not serious,

19:33.212 --> 19:34.754
but the treatment fee is 10,000,000 yen!

19:35.172 --> 19:36.339
Aw, no!

19:36.340 --> 19:38.009
I don't have a penny!

19:38.301 --> 19:40.552
Then start working and pay it back!

19:40.902 --> 19:42.493
I don't even have a job.

19:42.680 --> 19:45.515
I lost my fish market.

19:46.559 --> 19:50.020
Then why don't you work here?

19:50.896 --> 19:53.648
You know a lot about fish.

19:54.358 --> 19:56.547
That's from that aquarium!

19:56.819 --> 19:59.725
We called them and they told me that
they haven't hired anyone yet.

20:00.906 --> 20:02.365
I see...

20:02.992 --> 20:04.826
Thank you very much.

20:04.827 --> 20:07.289
I will work there honestly.

20:07.538 --> 20:11.416
I will pay the fee, no matter how many years it may take.

20:18.507 --> 20:19.549
Daddy!

20:21.761 --> 20:22.594
Dear!

20:23.304 --> 20:24.471
Daddy!

20:25.056 --> 20:25.889
Hiroko!

20:26.479 --> 20:27.432
Dear!

20:28.184 --> 20:30.602
Why are you here?

20:31.145 --> 20:35.404
Dr. Black Jack called us, and told us that you were hurt.

20:35.566 --> 20:37.067
I see, I see.

20:37.276 --> 20:40.570
Daddy, we can live together again, right?

20:40.780 --> 20:41.613
Yes.

20:41.614 --> 20:44.741
I'm going to work hard from now.

20:44.950 --> 20:48.286
Hiroko, I'm sorry that you missed me so much.

20:48.287 --> 20:49.412
Daddy!

20:51.707 --> 20:53.958
Bye!

20:58.464 --> 20:59.339
Pinoco!

20:59.340 --> 21:01.966
Don't follow any strangers from now on!

21:01.967 --> 21:03.676
Aye aye, sir!

21:04.512 --> 21:05.553
Don't joke around!

21:06.472 --> 21:07.597
I'm sorry.

21:08.062 --> 21:09.224
Doc!

21:09.433 --> 21:11.518
The special omelette is getting cold!

21:11.519 --> 21:12.894
Hurry!

21:13.729 --> 21:14.813
Okay, okay.

21:19.276 --> 21:22.320
We waited as long as we could,

21:22.321 --> 21:26.969
but the association members must
leave for their next meeting.

21:27.868 --> 21:30.161
I'm sorry about the missed opportunity.

21:31.539 --> 21:33.289
About your work?

21:33.874 --> 21:35.208
No, it's nothing.

21:35.668 --> 21:37.210
Can you go ahead and eat?

21:42.133 --> 21:43.216
Medical license, huh?

21:44.677 --> 21:46.469
It's not for me.

22:07.088 --> 22:19.043
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.088 --> 22:19.043
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.161 --> 22:24.160
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.161 --> 22:24.160
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.729 --> 22:31.198
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.729 --> 22:31.198
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.742 --> 22:37.200
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.742 --> 22:37.200
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.804 --> 22:40.289
being heated up by you,

22:37.804 --> 22:40.289
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.498 --> 22:48.275
so much that I change color

22:40.498 --> 22:48.275
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.360 --> 23:00.129
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.360 --> 23:00.129
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.337 --> 23:12.068
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.337 --> 23:12.068
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.308 --> 23:23.659
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.308 --> 23:23.659
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.845 --> 23:28.766
I couldn't be happier

23:23.845 --> 23:28.766
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.994 --> 23:33.928
How does it taste?

23:28.994 --> 23:33.927
oaji wa ikaga?

23:45.067 --> 24:15.073
The Idol who Lost Her Voice

23:47.082 --> 23:48.291
Hey, Wato-san.

23:48.292 --> 23:50.585
Our school idol, Asato Rei, right?

23:50.794 --> 23:53.254
Is it true that you were recruited by a talent office?

23:54.840 --> 23:56.215
You're so annoying!

23:56.425 --> 23:59.427
Don't use your voice for the next two weeks.

23:59.720 --> 24:00.720
Maybe a little won't...

24:03.140 --> 24:06.059
If I can't get my voice back, I'd rather die!

24:06.352 --> 24:07.643
100,000,000 yen.

24:08.115 --> 24:09.433
Promise me.

24:09.568 --> 24:10.622
Rei-chan is really...

24:11.690 --> 24:14.817
Next Karte - The Idol who Lost Her Voice.

24:16.153 --> 24:17.695
Karte NG...

24:22.910 --> 24:23.951
Cut, cut!

24:24.036 --> 24:24.660
I give up.
